cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If this software or its study results helped your research, please
  cite it using the metadata below.
title: Raman Oral-Cancer Classifier
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kanade
    given-names: Aryan
keywords:
  - Raman spectroscopy
  - SERS
  - oral cancer
  - OSCC
  - machine learning
  - patient-grouped cross-validation
  - triage
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/your-org/BARC"
abstract: >-
  Desktop application for classifying SERS Raman spectra of oral-cancer
  patients with maximum sensitivity, specificity and F1 score: 21-model
  registry under nested patient-grouped cross-validation, conformal
  triage sets, Grad-CAM/VIP/SHAP explainability checked against
  literature biochemistry, and a clinical reporting layer.
